1
00:00:00,228 --> 00:00:02,058
(Sheldon:)She's always complaining
about people at work.

2
00:00:02,063 --> 00:00:03,733
(Penny:)Well, so does Leonard.

3
00:00:03,731 --> 00:00:05,561
(Penny:)It's kind of annoying, but
it's not the end of the world.

4
00:00:05,566 --> 00:00:07,336
(Sheldon:)Do you know that when I get out
of the shower,

5
00:00:07,335 --> 00:00:10,935
(Sheldon:)she eyes me up and down
like I'm a piece of meat?

6
00:00:10,938 --> 00:00:12,168
(Penny:)You know, so does Leonard.

7
00:00:12,173 --> 00:00:13,473
(Penny:)Can't I just get ready
in the morning

8
00:00:13,474 --> 00:00:15,344
(Penny:)without him giving me
his goofy thumbs-up?

9
00:00:15,343 --> 00:00:16,743
"Hey."

10
00:00:17,612 --> 00:00:19,442
(Sheldon:)I know.

11
00:00:19,447 --> 00:00:21,547
(Sheldon:)Sometimes I would just like
to be appreciated for my mind.

12
00:00:21,549 --> 00:00:24,949
Agreed!
Thank you!

13
00:00:27,388 --> 00:00:29,858
(Bernadette:)That feels great.

14
00:00:29,857 --> 00:00:31,187
(Howard:)Well,

15
00:00:31,192 --> 00:00:32,762
(Howard:)pulling a quarter out
of your ear

16
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:35,700
(Howard:)isn't the only magic
these hands can do.

17
00:00:35,697 --> 00:00:39,227
In fact, wh-what's this

18
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:42,473
between your toes?!

19
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:46,340
(Bernadette:)Can you please stop making money
come out of me for two minutes?

20
00:00:52,447 --> 00:00:53,747
(Bernadette:)Was that the front door?

21
00:00:53,748 --> 00:00:55,748
(Howard:)It sounded like it.

22
00:00:55,750 --> 00:00:58,450
(Howard:)Oh, my God.
Someone's in the house.

23
00:00:58,453 --> 00:01:02,023
Lock the door, lock the door!

